{
  "title": "Refactor VSCode Extension to CLI-Only UI",
  "status": "closed",
  "prompt": "Refactor the semio-repo VS Code extension to delegate all business logic to the CLI. Fix file emoji mapping to use correct kind-specific emojis from CLI output. Replace client-side search with CLI tree --search. Fix artifact ID generation to produce correct emoji-prefixed IDs with full section paths. Extend CLI where incomplete. Refactor existing test file to cover all changes. No legacy API or backwards compatibility.",
